a specific answer to this question, no points for giving the more general answer… Exactly 20 years to the day after Gagarin’s first-ever spaceflight, a new kind of crewed spacecraft was launched for the first time. Unlike all previous crewed spacecraft, this was one designed from the ground up for reusability. It completed 36 orbits of the earth over 54 hours before gliding to a runway landing at Edwards Air Force Base. The mission was commanded by John Young, who was the ninth person to walk on the moon. The craft was named after the first American ship to circumnavigate the globe. Over the next 22 years, it craft was flown on 28 missions and completed over 4,800 orbits of earth, with the last mission ending in disaster upon reentry. For 10 points, name this craft that first flew on April 12, 1981.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:13Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Columbia ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:24Z", "username": "A", "text": "Challenger", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:29Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Endeavor?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:33Z", "username": "A", "text": "Oh ship", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:37Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Space Shuttle Columbia is correct.", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:50Z", "username": "Nikunj", "text": "Brilliant set of questions @⁨~Chinmay Mehta⁩. The thought and the stories behind each question were fantastic.\nGreat quizzing alm around by @⁨~Abhishek Vats⁩ , @⁨~Sid K⁩ & @⁨~Shubhankar⁩ . And also a special thanks to @⁨~Nikhil Borra⁩ for stepping in.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:45:55Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Nice continuous framing from one question to another 🙌🏻", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:46:15Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Here is a picture of the crew on STS-107, the final flight of Columbia ‎<attached: 00113656-PHOTO-2026-04-12-10-46-15.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:46:16Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Here is a picture of the crew on STS-107, the final flight of Columbia ‎<attached: 00113657-PHOTO-2026-04-12-10-46-16.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:46:31Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Vats: 15, Sal: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]